<div class="ei-returns">

  <div class="ei-returns__hero">
    <p class="ei-returns__eyebrow">Customer Care</p>
    <h1 class="ei-returns__headline">Returns & Refunds</h1>
    <p class="ei-returns__subline">We want you to love every piece. If something isn't right, we're here to help.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="ei-returns__meta-bar">
    <div class="ei-returns__meta-item">
      <span class="ei-returns__meta-num">14</span>
      <span class="ei-returns__meta-label">Days to return</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ei-returns__meta-divider"></div>
    <div class="ei-returns__meta-item">
      <span class="ei-returns__meta-num">Free</span>
      <span class="ei-returns__meta-label">Return shipping</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ei-returns__meta-divider"></div>
    <div class="ei-returns__meta-item">
      <span class="ei-returns__meta-num">5–10</span>
      <span class="ei-returns__meta-label">Days for refund</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ei-returns__meta-divider"></div>
    <div class="ei-returns__meta-item">
      <span class="ei-returns__meta-num">Original</span>
      <span class="ei-returns__meta-label">Payment method</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ei-returns__body">

    <div class="ei-returns__section">
      <p class="ei-returns__section-eyebrow">Overview</p>
      <h2 class="ei-returns__section-title">Our return policy</h2>
      <p class="ei-returns__text">We accept returns within 14 days of delivery. Items must be unworn, unwashed, and in their original condition with all tags attached. We reserve the right to refuse returns that do not meet these conditions.</p>
      <p class="ei-returns__text">This policy applies to all full-price and sale items unless otherwise stated at the time of purchase.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ei-returns__section ei-returns__section--alt">
      <p class="ei-returns__section-eyebrow">Eligibility</p>
      <h2 class="ei-returns__section-title">What can be returned</h2>
      <div class="ei-returns__two-col">
        <div>
          <p class="ei-returns__col-title ei-returns__col-title--yes">Eligible for return</p>
          <ul class="ei-returns__list ei-returns__list--yes">
            <li>Unworn clothing with original tags</li>
            <li>Unworn footwear in original box</li>
            <li>Unused accessories in original packaging</li>
            <li>Items in original, undamaged condition</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="ei-returns__col-title ei-returns__col-title--no">Not eligible for return</p>
          <ul class="ei-returns__list ei-returns__list--no">
            <li>Worn, washed, or altered items</li>
            <li>Swimwear and lingerie (hygiene policy)</li>
            <li>Pierced jewellery</li>
            <li>Items marked as final sale</li>
            <li>Items without original tags or packaging</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ei-returns__section">
      <p class="ei-returns__section-eyebrow">Process</p>
      <h2 class="ei-returns__section-title">How to return an item</h2>
      <div class="ei-returns__steps">
        <div class="ei-returns__step">
          <div class="ei-returns__step-num">01</div>
          <div class="ei-returns__step-body">
            <p class="ei-returns__step-title">Contact us</p>
            <p class="ei-returns__step-text">Email <a href="mailto:shop@elaraivyco.com">shop@elaraivyco.com</a> with your order number and reason for return. We will respond within 1–2 business days with your return authorisation.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ei-returns__step">
          <div class="ei-returns__step-num">02</div>
          <div class="ei-returns__step-body">
            <p class="ei-returns__step-title">Package your return</p>
            <p class="ei-returns__step-text">Securely pack the item in its original packaging with all tags attached. Include your order number inside the package.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ei-returns__step">
          <div class="ei-returns__step-num">03</div>
          <div class="ei-returns__step-body">
            <p class="ei-returns__step-title">Ship your return</p>
            <p class="ei-returns__step-text">Use the prepaid return label provided in your return authorisation email. Drop off at your nearest carrier location and keep the tracking receipt.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ei-returns__step">
          <div class="ei-returns__step-num">04</div>
          <div class="ei-returns__step-body">
            <p class="ei-returns__step-title">Receive your refund</p>
            <p class="ei-returns__step-text">Once we receive and inspect your return, we will process your refund within 5–10 business days to your original payment method. You will receive a confirmation email.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ei-returns__section ei-returns__section--alt">
      <p class="ei-returns__section-eyebrow">Exchanges</p>
      <h2 class="ei-returns__section-title">Need a different size or colour?</h2>
      <p class="ei-returns__text">We currently process exchanges as a return and new order. Return your original item following the process above, then place a new order for the item you'd like. This ensures the fastest processing time and guarantees your new size is reserved.</p>
      <p class="ei-returns__text">If you have any concerns about availability, please contact us before initiating your return and we will do our best to assist.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ei-returns__section ei-returns__section--navy">
      <p class="ei-returns__section-eyebrow ei-returns__section-eyebrow--light">Questions?</p>
      <h2 class="ei-returns__section-title ei-returns__section-title--light">We're here to help</h2>
      <p class="ei-returns__text ei-returns__text--light">Our team is happy to assist with any questions about your return or refund.</p>
      <a href="/pages/contact" class="ei-returns__cta">Contact us</a>
    </div>

  </div>

</div>

<style>
  .ei-returns {
    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;
    color: #0D1B3E;
  }

  .ei-returns__hero {
    background-color: #0D1B3E;
    padding: 64px 48px 56px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ei-returns__eyebrow {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #CFAE70;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .ei-returns__headline {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 52px);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #ffffff;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .ei-returns__subline {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    line-height: 1.85;
    max-width: 480px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ei-returns__meta-bar {
    background: #F5F3F0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #E8E4DF;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0;
    padding: 28px 48px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .ei-returns__meta-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 0 40px;
  }

  .ei-returns__meta-num {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #0D1B3E;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .ei-returns__meta-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #999;
  }

  .ei-returns__meta-divider {
    width: 1px;
    height: 40px;
    background: #D8D4CE;
  }

  .ei-returns__body {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ei-returns__section {
    padding: 56px 48px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #EDE9E4;
  }

  .ei-returns__section--alt {
    background: #FAFAF8;
  }

  .ei-returns__section--navy {
    background: #0D1B3E;
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .ei-returns__section-eyebrow {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #CFAE70;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .ei-returns__section-eyebrow--light {
    color: rgba(207,174,112,0.8);
  }

  .ei-returns__section-title {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 34px);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #0D1B3E;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ei-returns__section-title--light {
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .ei-returns__text {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: #444;
    line-height: 1.85;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .ei-returns__text--light {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    margin: 0 auto 28px;
  }

  .ei-returns__two-col {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .ei-returns__col-title {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid;
  }

  .ei-returns__col-title--yes {
    color: #1A6B1A;
    border-color: #1A6B1A;
  }

  .ei-returns__col-title--no {
    color: #993C1D;
    border-color: #993C1D;
  }

  .ei-returns__list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .ei-returns__list li {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: #444;
    padding-left: 20px;
    position: relative;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .ei-returns__list--yes li::before {
    content: '✓';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: #1A6B1A;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .ei-returns__list--no li::before {
    content: '✕';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: #993C1D;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .ei-returns__steps {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .ei-returns__step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 24px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #EDE9E4;
  }

  .ei-returns__step:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .ei-returns__step-num {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: #CFAE70;
    min-width: 36px;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .ei-returns__step-title {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #0D1B3E;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .ei-returns__step-text {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: #555;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .ei-returns__step-text a {
    color: #6E73B8;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .ei-returns__step-text a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .ei-returns__cta {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #0D1B3E;
    background: #CFAE70;
    padding: 14px 32px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
  }

  .ei-returns__cta:hover {
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .ei-returns__hero { padding: 48px 24px 40px; }
    .ei-returns__section { padding: 40px 24px; }
    .ei-returns__meta-bar { padding: 20px 24px; gap: 16px; }
    .ei-returns__meta-item { padding: 0 16px; }
    .ei-returns__meta-divider { display: none; }
    .ei-returns__two-col { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
  }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Returns Policy",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Returns Policy" }]
}
{% endschema %}
